ismatch can cause issues. Update the DSN to use the collation configured for the database and tables.",{"title":274,"searchDepth":282,"depth":282,"links":283},2,[284],{"id":246,"depth":282,"text":123,"children":285},[286,288],{"id":250,"depth":287,"text":251},3,{"id":262,"depth":287,"text":263},"Troubleshooting common installation issues related to database configuration and migrations.","md",null,{},true,{"title":123,"description":289},"CNdeV_pf4dDdSWV2ZDau1ekS6yNM8n4cirCMN-PzRgU",1795668795148,"327ba70d-3fd6-46b8-a994-eb9ed570f162"]